  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Street Football: A sport and educational tool for youth and adolescents values</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Centro de Estudios e Investigaciones Afro- Mundo Afro Organizaciones (Mundo Afro) and its partners, including former IAF grantee Fundacin Defensores del Chaco of Argentina, will use sports leagues and educational and cultural activities to further civic participation and tolerance among marginalized young Afro-Uruguayans in larger cities of Uruguay. The program includes outdoor events and performances by neighborhood musicians, dancers and actors. The work will benefit 2,500 young Afro-Uruguayans directly and another 8,000 indirectly.</narrative>
  </description>
